// Main toolbar — the button order + bitmap are the binary's (CToolBar::LoadToolBar(152);
// RT_TOOLBAR + RT_BITMAP id 152 extracted from CoD4Radiant.exe).  52 buttons + 13 separators;
// the icon strip is toolbar.bmp (832x16, 4bpp).  Each BUTTON maps to a WM_COMMAND id — wired
// handlers fire, the rest auto-grey like their menu items (CFrameWnd m_bAutoMenuEnable).
IDR_TOOLBAR152 BITMAP "toolbar.bmp"

