// ids are the binary's (1265 basepath / 1274 mapspath / 1253 entitypath / 1260 game / 1273
// basegame).  Layout is a clean functional reconstruction (the binary's exact rects were not
// extracted); the load-bearing part — the five control ids — matches the binary exactly.
