// ── Surface Inspector (CSurfaceDlg, IDD_SURFACE_INSPECTOR = 116) ────────────────
// The real 42-control layout, transcribed VERBATIM (rects/styles/text/ids) from the binary's
// RT_DIALOG #116 (DLGTEMPLATEEX, F:\...\surf_inspector_template.txt) and confirmed against the
// CSurfaceDlg cluster (msgmap 0x6e2e58, DoDataExchange 0x456c00, Select_SetTexture_2 0x4572d0,
// SurfaceInspector_GetMaterialDef 0x457950).  The IW3x font "Roboto Slab Light" is normalized
// back to stock "MS Sans Serif" per the IW3X caveat (as the other reconstructed dialogs do).
// Control IDs are the binary's — CSurfaceDlg's DDX / message map / GetDlgItem reads bind to them.
IDD_SURFACE_INSPECTOR DIALOGEX 400, 100, 259, 316
STYLE DS_SETFONT | DS_3DLOOK | WS_POPUP | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU
CAPTION "Surface inspector"
FONT 8, "MS Sans Serif", 400, 0, 0x0
