/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// String Table — MFC command-prompt / tooltip strings (RT_STRING extracted from
// IW3xRadiant.exe, 2026-07-03).  Format "Status-bar prompt\nTooltip": CFrameWnd's
// default OnToolTipText (TTN_NEEDTEXT) reads these by command id and shows the text
// after '\n' as the toolbar tooltip (CBRS_TOOLTIPS|CBRS_FLYBY are set on m_wndToolBar).
// The port had NO STRINGTABLE, so every toolbar button's tooltip was blank.
//
